    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Does the physical topology improve forecasts?</strong></p>
  - elementId: answer-3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [135, 455, 1060, 55]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.4
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>Yes, where it should.</strong> Node-level: +0.131 skill lift from the interconnector graph. Edge-level: +0.056 skill on cross-border spreads (5/5 seeds). Value concentrates on the irreducibly relational target.</p>
  - elementId: future-title
